## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Language | Python 3.11 | Core backend |
| Framework | FastAPI | REST API + async |
| ASGI Server | Uvicorn | Production server |
| Graph DB | Neo4j | Knowledge graph storage |
| Vector DB | ChromaDB | Embedding storage |
| Metadata DB | SQLite / PostgreSQL | Documents, events, logs |
| Event Bus | Redis Pub/Sub | Async event streaming |
| File Watcher | Watchdog | Real-time file monitoring |
| Scheduler | APScheduler | Periodic tasks |
| LLM | Google Gemini 1.5 Flash | Entity extraction + reasoning |
| Embeddings | Gemini Embedding API | Text embeddings |
| Validation | Pydantic v2 | Schema validation |
| ORM | SQLAlchemy 2.0 | DB operations |
| Migrations | Alembic | Schema versioning |
| Testing | Pytest | Unit + integration tests |

### Frontend Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Framework | React 18 | UI library |
| Build Tool | Vite | Fast dev server |
| Styling | TailwindCSS | Utility CSS |
| Routing | React Router v6 | Page navigation |
| HTTP Client | Axios | API calls |
| Charts | Recharts | Analytics visuals |
| Graph Viz | react-force-graph | KG visualization |
| Icons | Lucide React | Modern icons |
| Notifications | React Hot Toast | Toast messages |
| State | React Context + Hooks | Global state |
| Animations | Framer Motion | Smooth transitions |

### DevOps & Tools

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Docker | Neo4j + Redis containers |
| Docker Compose | Multi-container orchestration |
| Git | Version control |
| Postman / Thunder Client | API testing |
| Neo4j Browser | Graph inspection |
| Redis CLI | Event debugging |

