## 🎓 Learning Outcomes

By building this project, I mastered:

- 🧠 **GraphRAG architecture** — combining vector + graph retrieval
- 🔄 **Event-driven systems** — Redis pub/sub patterns
- 🤖 **LLM integration** — Gemini API for extraction, reasoning, embeddings
- 🕸️ **Neo4j Cypher queries** — MERGE, MATCH, path traversal
- 🧬 **Vector databases** — ChromaDB indexing & search
- 🐍 **Async Python** — FastAPI + asyncio
- ⚛️ **Modern React** — hooks, context, real-time UI
- 🎨 **TailwindCSS design** — glassmorphism, dark mode
- 📡 **Streaming APIs** — SSE for live updates
- 🐳 **Docker Compose** — multi-service orchestration
- 📊 **Data visualization** — force-directed graphs, charts

