## 🌟 Introduction

Enterprise knowledge is **never static**. Policies change, documents get updated, new research arrives daily. Traditional RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) systems become **stale the moment** their knowledge base changes, leading to:

- ❌ Outdated answers
- ❌ Contradictory reasoning
- ❌ Broken knowledge graphs
- ❌ Manual re-indexing overhead

**Autonomous AI Knowledge Evolution System** solves this by building a **self-evolving AI pipeline** that:

- 👁️ Monitors knowledge sources in **real-time**
- 🔄 Automatically **updates the knowledge graph**
- 🧬 **Retrains retrieval** with fresh embeddings
- ✅ **Maintains reasoning consistency** across all answers

This project demonstrates a **production-grade GraphRAG architecture** with event-driven evolution — but optimized to run on a **CPU-only laptop** using Google Gemini's free API.

---

## ❗ Problem Statement

Modern enterprises face a critical challenge:

> **"How do we keep AI systems aligned with rapidly changing knowledge — without manual intervention?"**

### The 4 Core Problems:

| # | Problem | Impact |
|---|---------|--------|
| 1 | **Stale Knowledge** | AI answers based on old documents |
| 2 | **Manual Re-indexing** | Engineers must re-run embedding jobs |
| 3 | **Graph Inconsistency** | Knowledge graph diverges from source docs |
| 4 | **Reasoning Drift** | Same question yields different answers over time |

### Existing Solutions Fall Short:

- **Traditional RAG** → Static, no evolution
- **Fine-tuning** → Slow, expensive, not real-time
- **Manual pipelines** → Error-prone, not autonomous
- **Graph DB alone** → No semantic retrieval

---

## 💡 Solution Overview

This system introduces an **autonomous feedback loop**:

```
Knowledge Source Change
        ↓
[Detection Layer]  → File watcher + hash diffing
        ↓
[Event Layer]      → Redis pub/sub stream
        ↓
[Evolution Layer]  → Graph update + Re-embedding
        ↓
[Retrieval Layer]  → Hybrid GraphRAG search
        ↓
[Consistency Layer] → Reasoning verification
        ↓
Updated, Consistent, Fresh Knowledge ✅
```

Every layer is **decoupled**, **event-driven**, and **autonomous**.

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 🎯 Core Capabilities

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Real-Time Monitoring** | Watchdog-based file watcher tracks all knowledge sources |
| **Change Detection** | SHA-256 hashing identifies modified/added/deleted docs |
| **Autonomous Graph Evolution** | Gemini extracts entities & relations, Neo4j updates graph |
| **Incremental Re-Embedding** | Only changed chunks re-embedded (efficient) |
| **Hybrid GraphRAG Retrieval** | Vector search (ChromaDB) + Graph traversal (Neo4j) |
| **Reasoning Consistency Guard** | Detects contradictions & verifies answer stability |
| **Event Streaming** | Redis pub/sub broadcasts all evolution events |
| **Live Dashboard** | React UI with real-time updates |
| **Interactive Graph Viz** | Force-directed knowledge graph visualization |
| **Event Timeline** | Full audit trail of every system evolution |

### 🎨 UI Features

- 🌙 Dark mode with glassmorphism
- 📊 Live stat cards & charts
- 🕸️ Interactive graph (drag, zoom, click nodes)
- 💬 Chat interface for RAG queries
- ⚡ Real-time event feed
- 🔔 Toast notifications
- 📱 Fully responsive design

### ⚙️ Technical Features

- ✅ CPU-only (no GPU required)
- ✅ Free tier friendly (Gemini API)
- ✅ Async FastAPI backend
- ✅ Modular service architecture
- ✅ RESTful API with OpenAPI docs
- ✅ SQLite / PostgreSQL flexible
- ✅ Docker support for Neo4j + Redis

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

### High-Level Architecture

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     KNOWLEDGE SOURCES                        │
│    (PDFs, DOCX, TXT, Markdown, Live Feeds, APIs)             │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    MONITORING LAYER                          │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐        │
│  │ File Watcher │  │ Hash Diffing │  │ API Poller   │        │
│  │  (Watchdog)  │  │  (SHA-256)   │  │  (Optional)  │        │
│  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘        │
└─────────┼─────────────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────┘
          │                 │                 │
          └─────────────────┴─────────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     EVENT STREAM LAYER                       │
│              Redis Pub/Sub  |  Event Queue                   │
│  Events: DOC_ADDED, DOC_UPDATED, DOC_DELETED, EVOLUTION_DONE │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    EVOLUTION WORKER                          │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  1. Parse Document (PDF/DOCX/TXT)                      │  │
│  │  2. Chunk Text (semantic chunking)                     │  │
│  │  3. Extract Entities (Gemini API)                      │  │
│  │  4. Extract Relations (Gemini API)                     │  │
│  │  5. Update Neo4j Graph                                 │  │
│  │  6. Generate Embeddings (Gemini)                       │  │
│  │  7. Update ChromaDB Index                              │  │
│  │  8. Log Evolution Event                                │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   STORAGE LAYER                              │
│  ┌────────────┐  ┌────────────┐  ┌────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  Neo4j     │  │  ChromaDB  │  │  SQLite / PostgreSQL   │  │
│  │ (Graph DB) │  │ (Vectors)  │  │  (Metadata + Events)   │  │
│  └────────────┘  └────────────┘  └────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   RETRIEVAL LAYER (GraphRAG)                 │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  Query → Embed → Vector Search → Graph Expand → Rank   │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  CONSISTENCY LAYER                           │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  Verify Answer → Detect Contradictions → Log Trace     │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    FRONTEND (React)                          │
│  Dashboard | Documents | Graph | Chat | Evolution | Events   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Data Flow Diagram

```
User Uploads Document
        │
        ▼
[FastAPI] /api/documents/upload
        │
        ▼
[Parser] → Extract text → Chunk → Hash
        │
        ▼
[SQL DB] Store metadata
        │
        ▼
[Event Bus] Publish: DOC_ADDED
        │
        ▼
[Worker] Picks up event
        │
        ├──▶ [Gemini] Extract entities
        ├──▶ [Gemini] Extract relations
        ├──▶ [Gemini] Generate embeddings
        │
        ▼
[Neo4j] Insert nodes + edges
[ChromaDB] Insert vectors
        │
        ▼
[Event Bus] Publish: EVOLUTION_COMPLETE
        │
        ▼
[Frontend] WebSocket/SSE → Live update
```

