## 🔌 API Endpoints

### Health

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/health` | Service health check |
| GET | `/` | Root info |

### Documents

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/documents/upload` | Upload new document |
| GET | `/api/documents/` | List all documents |
| GET | `/api/documents/{id}` | Get document details |
| DELETE | `/api/documents/{id}` | Delete document |

### Knowledge Graph

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/kg/nodes` | List all nodes |
| GET | `/api/kg/edges` | List all edges |
| GET | `/api/kg/graph` | Full graph (for viz) |
| GET | `/api/kg/node/{id}` | Node details + neighbors |
| POST | `/api/kg/query` | Custom Cypher query |

### Retrieval

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/retrieval/search` | Semantic search |
| POST | `/api/retrieval/ask` | GraphRAG Q&A |
| GET | `/api/retrieval/history` | Past queries |

### Evolution

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/evolution/trigger` | Manually trigger evolution |
| GET | `/api/evolution/history` | Evolution timeline |
| GET | `/api/evolution/status` | Current pipeline status |

### Consistency

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/consistency/check` | Verify answer consistency |
| GET | `/api/consistency/history` | Past checks |
| GET | `/api/consistency/contradictions` | Detected contradictions |

### Events

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/events/` | List all events |
| GET | `/api/events/stream` | SSE live stream |

### Dashboard

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/dashboard/stats` | Overview statistics |
| GET | `/api/dashboard/charts` | Chart data |

