## 🎯 Use Cases

### 1. 🏢 Enterprise Knowledge Base
Auto-updating internal wikis and policy documents. AI always gives current answers.

### 2. 📚 Research Assistant
Self-evolving literature graphs. New papers auto-integrated.

### 3. 🏥 Healthcare Compliance
Track policy changes across hospital guidelines in real-time.

### 4. ⚖️ Legal Document Evolution
Monitor contract changes, flag contradictions.

### 5. 🎓 Adaptive Education
Curriculum that evolves with new standards.

### 6. 🤖 Enterprise Chatbot
Always-fresh Q&A over internal docs.

### 7. 📰 News Intelligence
Real-time event graph from news feeds.

