## 🏗️ System Architecture

### High-Level Architecture

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     KNOWLEDGE SOURCES                        │
│    (PDFs, DOCX, TXT, Markdown, Live Feeds, APIs)             │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    MONITORING LAYER                          │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐        │
│  │ File Watcher │  │ Hash Diffing │  │ API Poller   │        │
│  │  (Watchdog)  │  │  (SHA-256)   │  │  (Optional)  │        │
│  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘        │
└─────────┼─────────────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────┘
          │                 │                 │
          └─────────────────┴─────────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     EVENT STREAM LAYER                       │
│              Redis Pub/Sub  |  Event Queue                   │
│  Events: DOC_ADDED, DOC_UPDATED, DOC_DELETED, EVOLUTION_DONE │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    EVOLUTION WORKER                          │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  1. Parse Document (PDF/DOCX/TXT)                      │  │
│  │  2. Chunk Text (semantic chunking)                     │  │
│  │  3. Extract Entities (Gemini API)                      │  │
│  │  4. Extract Relations (Gemini API)                     │  │
│  │  5. Update Neo4j Graph                                 │  │
│  │  6. Generate Embeddings (Gemini)                       │  │
│  │  7. Update ChromaDB Index                              │  │
│  │  8. Log Evolution Event                                │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   STORAGE LAYER                              │
│  ┌────────────┐  ┌────────────┐  ┌────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  Neo4j     │  │  ChromaDB  │  │  SQLite / PostgreSQL   │  │
│  │ (Graph DB) │  │ (Vectors)  │  │  (Metadata + Events)   │  │
│  └────────────┘  └────────────┘  └────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   RETRIEVAL LAYER (GraphRAG)                 │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  Query → Embed → Vector Search → Graph Expand → Rank   │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  CONSISTENCY LAYER                           │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  Verify Answer → Detect Contradictions → Log Trace     │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    FRONTEND (React)                          │
│  Dashboard | Documents | Graph | Chat | Evolution | Events   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Data Flow Diagram

```
User Uploads Document
        │
        ▼
[FastAPI] /api/documents/upload
        │
        ▼
[Parser] → Extract text → Chunk → Hash
        │
        ▼
[SQL DB] Store metadata
        │
        ▼
[Event Bus] Publish: DOC_ADDED
        │
        ▼
[Worker] Picks up event
        │
        ├──▶ [Gemini] Extract entities
        ├──▶ [Gemini] Extract relations
        ├──▶ [Gemini] Generate embeddings
        │
        ▼
[Neo4j] Insert nodes + edges
[ChromaDB] Insert vectors
        │
        ▼
[Event Bus] Publish: EVOLUTION_COMPLETE
        │
        ▼
[Frontend] WebSocket/SSE → Live update
```

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Language | Python 3.11 | Core backend |
| Framework | FastAPI | REST API + async |
| ASGI Server | Uvicorn | Production server |
| Graph DB | Neo4j | Knowledge graph storage |
| Vector DB | ChromaDB | Embedding storage |
| Metadata DB | SQLite / PostgreSQL | Documents, events, logs |
| Event Bus | Redis Pub/Sub | Async event streaming |
| File Watcher | Watchdog | Real-time file monitoring |
| Scheduler | APScheduler | Periodic tasks |
| LLM | Google Gemini 1.5 Flash | Entity extraction + reasoning |
| Embeddings | Gemini Embedding API | Text embeddings |
| Validation | Pydantic v2 | Schema validation |
| ORM | SQLAlchemy 2.0 | DB operations |
| Migrations | Alembic | Schema versioning |
| Testing | Pytest | Unit + integration tests |

### Frontend Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Framework | React 18 | UI library |
| Build Tool | Vite | Fast dev server |
| Styling | TailwindCSS | Utility CSS |
| Routing | React Router v6 | Page navigation |
| HTTP Client | Axios | API calls |
| Charts | Recharts | Analytics visuals |
| Graph Viz | react-force-graph | KG visualization |
| Icons | Lucide React | Modern icons |
| Notifications | React Hot Toast | Toast messages |
| State | React Context + Hooks | Global state |
| Animations | Framer Motion | Smooth transitions |

### DevOps & Tools

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Docker | Neo4j + Redis containers |
| Docker Compose | Multi-container orchestration |
| Git | Version control |
| Postman / Thunder Client | API testing |
| Neo4j Browser | Graph inspection |
| Redis CLI | Event debugging |

